                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Every zone (masked / anonymised / restricted) is gated by HDFS ACLs before a query reaches the raw data.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10D",
                      "color": "#C8D6F0",
                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold'"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10D",
                      "color": "#C8D6F0",
                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold'"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "GUEST and DATA_ANALYST are denied the restricted zone; only ADMIN sees it. Security Analysts keep masked + anonymised access.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10D",
                      "color": "#C8D6F0",
                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold'"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10D",
                      "color": "#C8D6F0",
                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold'"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Masking and anonymisation are applied upstream (Spark), so analysts never touch raw PAN data.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10D",
                      "color": "#C8D6F0",
                      "fontFamily": "'Segoe UI Semibold'"
                    }
                  }
                ],
